OL,3,GNEWSAWales faces cuts from Healey's
OL,4,ABudget, country's ministers claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK and Welsh governments have
OL,7,Ftraded accusations about the state of
OL,8,Ffunding for Wales' public services
OL,9,Fafter the chancellor's Budget.
OL,11,FWales' finance minister Elin Jones said
OL,12,Fan extra #450m over three years for the
OL,13,Fcountry worked out at a "real-terms
OL,14,Fcut" because it was below the rate of
OL,15,Finflation.
OL,17,FBut UK Treasury minister Torsten Bell
OL,18,Fsaid that was only because Wales had
OL,19,Falready been given "shed loads" of
OL,20,Fextra funding in a one-off payment last
OL,21,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
