OL,3,GNEWSAWales faces cuts from Healey's
OL,4,ABudget, country's ministers claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FDuring his speech to Parliament on
OL,7,FWednesday, UK Chancellor John Healey
OL,8,Furged the Welsh government to implement
OL,9,Fits own #100 "household energy payment"
OL,10,Fthat he announced for council taxpayers
OL,11,Fin England.
